  "articleBody": "Before construction begins, document the home’s condition, confirm the responsible permitting authority, identify potential historic-review issues, and have the renovation scope developed around existing structural and mechanical conditions. A complete preparation package helps a remodeling team price the work more accurately and reduces surprises after walls or ceilings are opened.",
